ofile, so get_user_details will show that. Then, use modify_pending_order_address with the correct address details. Also, changing the item color to red requires modifying the item in the pending order. Need to confirm the item ID for the red color variant. This might involve checking product details with get_product_details to find the correct item ID for the red option. Then, use modify_pending_order_items with the new item ID.\n\nFinally, retrieving the tracking number for the cancelled order. Once the user confirms which order is cancelled, get_order_details will provide the tracking info.\n\nI need to make sure each action is confirmed by the user before proceeding, especially for returns and modifications. Also, check that all order statuses are appropriate (delivered for returns, pending for address/item changes). If any step requires information not provided, I'll need to ask the user for clarification.\n</think>\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"get_user_details\", \"arguments\": {\"user_id\": \"lucas_brown_6720\"}}\n",
